},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-19T14:12:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T15:47:32Z","closed_at":"2026-06-24T15:21:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120453","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120453.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120453.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-24T15:21:14Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #105926.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nGDScript has a very complex loading/caching system, which is also used for dependency tracking. Under these circumstances, it's difficult to say whether the assumption \"the base class must be compiled before the current class\" is met. I previously assumed that circular dependencies were only possible in the analyzer, and that the compiler diligently avoided them by compiling each class separately (which is somewhat true). However, after briefly examining `GDScriptCache`, I'm no longer sure what guarantees are actually provided.\r\n\r\nSo, I'd prefer to stick with a simpler and less invasive solution to fix the bug for now. Since generating a doc name for a specific GDScript class is relatively reliable (deterministic, idempotent, and has little dependence on the cache system), I decided to fix it locally within `GDScriptDocGen`. I still believe that violating the assumption \"the base class must be compiled before the current class\" can lead to other, more serious bugs. But given the high complexity of the cache system and the lack of other issues clearly related to compilation order (as far as I know), I'd prefer not to touch `GDScriptCache` for now.\r\n\r\nCC @Cykyrios","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120453/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}